WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.605
We will reuse these variables throughout the module
Patient ID

00:00:05.618 --> 00:00:11.581
is an identifier Triage level is an ordered category
Temperature

00:00:11.607 --> 00:00:17.252
is a measurement Emergency visits is a count Device
payload is

00:00:17.278 --> 00:00:23.319
nested JSON and a clinical note is free text Notice
that the questions

00:00:23.345 --> 00:00:29.850
are different Some questions are about dataset
organization Others

00:00:29.876 --> 00:00:36.428
are about measurement meaning Others are about
numeric behavior Learning

00:00:36.455 --> 00:00:40.481
to identify which question you are answering is one
of the most important skills in

00:00:40.507 --> 00:00:41.297
this module
